---
/**
 * Request-path flowchart for the storefront fallback. The main spine is the
 * happy path; the right column is every early exit or cached path.
 */
---

<figure class="fc-diagram">
  <svg
    viewBox="0 0 900 1030"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="fc-flow-title fc-flow-desc"
  >
    <title id="fc-flow-title">Storefront SSR request flowchart</title>
    <desc id="fc-flow-desc">
      The storefront router checks the Host, redirects and discovery files, SSR
      enablement, the active deployment, and the route cache before forwarding
      the request to workerd. Successful responses are cached only when they are
      cacheable, then streamed to the browser. Failures return 404, 503 or 502.
    </desc>

    <defs>
      <marker
        id="fc-flow-arrow"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="9"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto-start-reverse"
      >
        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" class="fc-arrow"></path>
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <!-- Route-cache legend -->
    <rect class="fc-box-muted" x="580" y="20" width="290" height="124" rx="8"></rect>
    <text class="fc-label-strong" x="596" y="44">Route cache</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="596" y="64">GET only; bypassed by Authorization,</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="596" y="80">Cookie or Cache-Control: no-cache.</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="596" y="100">Key: store + path + query +</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="596" y="116">Accept-Language. Max 2 MiB, 1,000 entries.</text>

    <!-- 1 -->
    <rect class="fc-step-brand" x="150" y="20" width="340" height="54" rx="9"></rect>
    <text class="fc-label-strong" x="320" y="42" text-anchor="middle">GET /products/hoodie</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="320" y="60" text-anchor="middle">Host: shop.example.com</text>

    <!-- 2 -->
    <rect class="fc-step" x="150" y="98" width="340" height="54" rx="9"></rect>
    <text class="fc-label-strong" x="320" y="120" text-anchor="middle">Router fallback</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="320" y="138" text-anchor="middle">API, /internal, /health and /metrics handled first</text>

    <!-- 3 -->
    <rect class="fc-step" x="150" y="176" width="340" height="54" rx="9"></rect>
    <text class="fc-label-strong" x="320" y="198" text-anchor="middle">Resolve Host → active store</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="320" y="216" text-anchor="middle">store id · locale · currency · timezone</text>
    <path class="fc-line" d="M 490 203 H 578" marker-end="url(#fc-flow-arrow)"></path>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="534" y="194" text-anchor="middle">No</text>
    <rect class="fc-box" x="580" y="176" width="290" height="54" rx="8"></rect>
    <text class="fc-label-strong" x="596" y="198">404 not found</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="596" y="216">no active store for this Host</text>

    <!-- 4 -->
    <rect class="fc-step" x="150" y="254" width="340" height="54" rx="9"></rect>
    <text class="fc-label-strong" x="320" y="276" text-anchor="middle">Redirect or discovery route?</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="320" y="294" text-anchor="middle">stored redirect · /robots.txt · /sitemap.xml</text>
    <path class="fc-line" d="M 490 281 H 578" marker-end="url(#fc-flow-arrow)"></path>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="534" y="272" text-anchor="middle">Yes</text>
    <rect class="fc-box" x="580" y="254" width="290" height="54" rx="8"></rect>
    <text class="fc-label-strong" x="596" y="276">Redirect or generated file</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="596" y="294">stored status + Location</text>

    <!-- 5 -->
    <rect class="fc-step" x="150" y="332" width="340" height="54" rx="9"></rect>
    <text class="fc-label-strong" x="320" y="354" text-anchor="middle">Universal SSR enabled?</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="320" y="372" text-anchor="middle">SsrService configured and started</text>
    <path class="fc-line" d="M 490 359 H 578" marker-end="url(#fc-flow-arrow)"></path>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="534" y="350" text-anchor="middle">No</text>
    <rect class="fc-box" x="580" y="332" width="290" height="54" rx="8"></rect>
    <text class="fc-label-strong" x="596" y="354">404 not found</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="596" y="372">no universal runtime configured</text>

    <!-- 6 -->
    <rect class="fc-step" x="150" y="410" width="340" height="54" rx="9"></rect>
    <text class="fc-label-strong" x="320" y="432" text-anchor="middle">Active deployment for this store?</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="320" y="450" text-anchor="middle">artifact · runtime group · gateway</text>
    <path class="fc-line" d="M 490 437 H 578" marker-end="url(#fc-flow-arrow)"></path>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="534" y="428" text-anchor="middle">No</text>
    <rect class="fc-box" x="580" y="410" width="290" height="54" rx="8"></rect>
    <text class="fc-label-strong" x="596" y="432">404 SSR_DEPLOYMENT_NOT_FOUND</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="596" y="450">store has no active deployment</text>

    <!-- 7 -->
    <rect class="fc-step" x="150" y="488" width="340" height="54" rx="9"></rect>
    <text class="fc-label-strong" x="320" y="510" text-anchor="middle">Build SsrRequestContext</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="320" y="528" text-anchor="middle">store · deployment · request id · scheme · token</text>

    <!-- 8 -->
    <rect class="fc-step" x="150" y="566" width="340" height="54" rx="9"></rect>
    <text class="fc-label-strong" x="320" y="588" text-anchor="middle">Cacheable GET and cache hit?</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="320" y="606" text-anchor="middle">see route-cache rules above</text>
    <path class="fc-line" d="M 490 593 H 578" marker-end="url(#fc-flow-arrow)"></path>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="534" y="584" text-anchor="middle">Yes</text>
    <rect class="fc-box" x="580" y="566" width="290" height="54" rx="8"></rect>
    <text class="fc-label-strong" x="596" y="588">200 from cache</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="596" y="606">x-fastcart-cache: HIT · Age</text>

    <!-- 9 -->
    <rect class="fc-step" x="150" y="644" width="340" height="54" rx="9"></rect>
    <text class="fc-label-strong" x="320" y="666" text-anchor="middle">Gateway forwards over loopback</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="320" y="684" text-anchor="middle">strip client x-fastcart-* · inject trusted values</text>

    <!-- 10 -->
    <rect class="fc-step-brand" x="150" y="722" width="340" height="54" rx="9"></rect>
    <text class="fc-label-strong" x="320" y="744" text-anchor="middle">workerd executes the Worker</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="320" y="762" text-anchor="middle">render HTML · stream · call the internal API</text>

    <!-- 11 -->
    <rect class="fc-step" x="150" y="800" width="340" height="54" rx="9"></rect>
    <text class="fc-label-strong" x="320" y="822" text-anchor="middle">Runtime error?</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="320" y="840" text-anchor="middle">gateway or transport failure</text>
    <path class="fc-line" d="M 490 827 H 578" marker-end="url(#fc-flow-arrow)"></path>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="534" y="818" text-anchor="middle">Yes</text>
    <rect class="fc-box" x="580" y="800" width="290" height="54" rx="8"></rect>
    <text class="fc-label-strong" x="596" y="822">503 or 502 JSON</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="596" y="840">runtime unavailable · request failed</text>

    <!-- 12 -->
    <rect class="fc-step" x="150" y="878" width="340" height="54" rx="9"></rect>
    <text class="fc-label-strong" x="320" y="900" text-anchor="middle">Cacheable response?</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="320" y="918" text-anchor="middle">200 · no Set-Cookie · positive max-age/s-maxage</text>
    <path class="fc-line" d="M 490 905 H 578" marker-end="url(#fc-flow-arrow)"></path>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="534" y="896" text-anchor="middle">No</text>
    <rect class="fc-box" x="580" y="878" width="290" height="54" rx="8"></rect>
    <text class="fc-label-strong" x="596" y="900">Stream uncached</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="596" y="918">no-store when the Worker omitted it</text>

    <!-- 13 -->
    <rect class="fc-step-brand" x="150" y="956" width="340" height="54" rx="9"></rect>
    <text class="fc-label-strong" x="320" y="978" text-anchor="middle">Buffer, cache, then stream to browser</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="320" y="996" text-anchor="middle">x-fastcart-cache: MISS only when stored</text>

    <!-- Main spine -->
    <path class="fc-line" d="M 320 74 V 96" marker-end="url(#fc-flow-arrow)"></path>
    <path class="fc-line" d="M 320 152 V 174" marker-end="url(#fc-flow-arrow)"></path>
    <path class="fc-line" d="M 320 230 V 252" marker-end="url(#fc-flow-arrow)"></path>
    <path class="fc-line" d="M 320 308 V 330" marker-end="url(#fc-flow-arrow)"></path>
    <path class="fc-line" d="M 320 386 V 408" marker-end="url(#fc-flow-arrow)"></path>
    <path class="fc-line" d="M 320 464 V 486" marker-end="url(#fc-flow-arrow)"></path>
    <path class="fc-line" d="M 320 542 V 564" marker-end="url(#fc-flow-arrow)"></path>
    <path class="fc-line" d="M 320 620 V 642" marker-end="url(#fc-flow-arrow)"></path>
    <path class="fc-line" d="M 320 698 V 720" marker-end="url(#fc-flow-arrow)"></path>
    <path class="fc-line" d="M 320 776 V 798" marker-end="url(#fc-flow-arrow)"></path>
    <path class="fc-line" d="M 320 854 V 876" marker-end="url(#fc-flow-arrow)"></path>
    <path class="fc-line" d="M 320 932 V 954" marker-end="url(#fc-flow-arrow)"></path>

    <text class="fc-sub" x="328" y="164">matched</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="328" y="242">Yes</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="328" y="320">No</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="328" y="398">Yes</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="328" y="476">Yes</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="328" y="632">No</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="328" y="710">forward</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="328" y="866">No</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="328" y="944">Yes: store, then stream</text>
  </svg>
  <figcaption>
    <strong>Figure 2.</strong> The storefront fallback path. Only unmatched
    paths reach this code: API, health, metrics and <code>/internal</code>
    namespaces are routed earlier. Redirects and discovery files are answered
    before the runtime is consulted, so they keep working when SSR is disabled.
  </figcaption>
</figure>
